{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete challenging levels on single-player or multiplayer (2-4 players). Players can complete the game from level 1. Also, players can freely choose all unlocked levels from the start. Gameplay is easy as you can think of a casual game just completing on each level, but do not forget this is Another Level game that is different from usual levels. Good luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Multiple gameplay :</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique and different gameplay for some levels. There will be interesting gameplay that players have not ever experienced before.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Multiplayer playing with friend :\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete challenging levels with a friend (2-4 players). Those who knock out first will be watching other players until they finish the level. The game will restart level once all players have lost.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Challenging and unique level :\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The levels might be hard or easy with unique and good seeing graphics. There are some strange platforms that can make players lose from the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3618910?t=1749485407","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618910/ea6e659567ff6f6cfaeeb0f698e97318c74d6b97/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749485407","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618910/c560897fcfd50fed6837643f20662e29c5399afb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749485407","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618910/c560897fcfd50fed6837643f20662e29c5399afb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749485407","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Onli